WEBVTT

00:00.905 --> 00:03.802
<i>[upbeat music]</i>
<i>[欢快的音乐]</i>

00:03.871 --> 00:09.422
<i>♪ ♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>

00:09.491 --> 00:12.905
[whistling melody]
[口哨旋律]

00:14.836 --> 00:18.939
[grunts]
Special delivery!
[咕哝]
特别发货！

00:19.008 --> 00:22.560
Ooh, my new rock
is finally here!
哦，我的新摇滚
终于来了！

00:24.112 --> 00:28.664
Hold on, polka dots?
等等，波尔卡圆点？

00:28.733 --> 00:31.008
I ordered plaid.
我订的是格子。

00:31.077 --> 00:33.871
You'll have to take it back,
Mr. Mailman.
你必须把它拿回来
邮递员先生。

00:33.939 --> 00:35.388
[bones cracking]
- Back?
[骨头碎裂]
- 回来？

00:37.043 --> 00:40.871
- Mr. Mailman?
- My back.
- 邮递员先生？
- 我的背。

00:44.905 --> 00:49.733
- You okay, buddy?
- Gotta deliver mail.
- 你还好吗，伙计？
- 必须递送邮件。

00:49.802 --> 00:53.457
You are in no shape
to deliver anything, fella.
你没有任何形状
交付任何东西，伙计。

00:53.526 --> 00:56.353
Just relax
and crash at my place.
放松一下
并在我的地方坠毁。

00:56.422 --> 00:59.043
I'll deliver your mail
for you today.
我会递送你的邮件
今天给你。

01:01.457 --> 01:05.353
Oops, almost forgot my mail bag.
哎呀，差点忘了我的邮袋。

01:05.422 --> 01:09.491
Oops, almost forgot
my mailman hat.
哎呀差点忘了
我的邮递员帽子。

01:10.836 --> 01:13.526
[humming melody]
All righty.
[哼唱的旋律]
好吧。

01:13.595 --> 01:17.284
Let's see
where my first delivery is.
让我们看看
我的第一次送货是在哪里。

01:17.353 --> 01:20.112
[straining]
[紧张]

01:20.181 --> 01:23.526
Oh, I can't read this!
哦，我看不懂这个！

01:25.319 --> 01:27.802
[knocks]
[敲门声]

01:27.871 --> 01:30.836
Hey, Patrick, I thought
that sounded like your head.
嘿，帕特里克，我想
听起来就像你的头。

01:30.905 --> 01:33.388
SpongeBob,
do you know where this
海绵宝宝，
你知道这个在哪里吗

01:33.457 --> 01:35.871
Spon-gee-Boob
海绵布布

01:35.939 --> 01:39.319
Squir-pa-Nants lives?
斯奎尔帕南特还活着吗？

01:39.388 --> 01:43.146
- Never heard of him.
- Oh, well, return to sender.
- 从没听说过他。
- 哦，好吧，返回发件人。

01:43.215 --> 01:45.802
Hey, what's with
the new threads?
嘿，怎么了
新线程？

01:45.871 --> 01:48.871
I'm a mailman now!
[laughs]
我现在是一名邮递员了！
[笑]

01:48.939 --> 01:50.319
Wow!
哇！

01:50.388 --> 01:52.457
I've always wanted
to be a mailman.
我一直想要
成为一名邮递员。

01:52.526 --> 01:54.802
It's like getting to be Santa
every day,
就像成为圣诞老人一样
每天，

01:54.871 --> 01:57.181
except Sundays.
周日除外。

01:57.250 --> 02:01.491
Sorry, SpongeBob,
but I'm the mailman now.
对不起，海绵宝宝，
但我现在是邮递员。

02:01.560 --> 02:04.008
Oh, okay.
哦好的。

02:04.077 --> 02:07.733
But you can be my postal pal!
但你可以成为我的邮友！

02:07.802 --> 02:12.181
Whee!
Oh, ah!
哎哟！
哦，啊！

02:12.250 --> 02:14.560
Let's get mailing.
我们去邮寄吧。

02:14.629 --> 02:18.250
<i>♪ ♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>

02:18.319 --> 02:21.974
Postal pal,
you may ring the doorbell.
邮政朋友，
你可以按门铃。

02:22.043 --> 02:23.215
[gasps]
[喘气]

02:23.284 --> 02:25.422
Yes, sir, Mr. Mailman, sir.
是的，先生，邮差先生，先生。

02:25.491 --> 02:27.560
Oh, I better warm up
the old bell ringer.
哦，我最好热身一下
老敲钟人

02:27.629 --> 02:31.871
Up, down, up, down.
Twist right, twist left.
上，下，上，下。
向右扭转，向左扭转。

02:31.939 --> 02:34.388
And polish the nail.
并擦亮指甲。

02:35.664 --> 02:37.939
[exhales]
[呼气]

02:38.008 --> 02:39.457
[doorbell rings]
[门铃响]

02:41.457 --> 02:42.733
Mail!
邮件！

02:42.802 --> 02:45.664
They let a moron like you
deliver the mail?
他们让像你这样的白痴
递送邮件？

02:45.733 --> 02:49.146
Oh, you'd be surprised
what they let morons do.
哦，你会感到惊讶的
他们让白痴做什么。

02:49.215 --> 02:51.008
[gasps]
[喘气]

02:51.077 --> 02:53.871
It's here!
[laughs]
就在这里！
[笑]

02:53.939 --> 02:56.526
What's wrong
with Squidward's face?
怎么了
带着章鱼哥的脸？

02:56.595 --> 02:58.905
[laughing]
[笑]

02:58.974 --> 03:01.664
I think he's smiling.
我认为他在微笑。

03:01.733 --> 03:05.353
I finally got it,
my turbo clarinet.
我终于明白了
我的涡轮单簧管。

03:06.526 --> 03:08.526
[engine rumbles]
[发动机隆隆声]

03:08.595 --> 03:10.008
[inhales deeply]
[深吸一口气]

03:10.077 --> 03:11.939
[horn toots]
- Whoa!
[喇叭嘟嘟]
- 哇！

03:12.008 --> 03:14.974
[both screaming]
[两人尖叫]

03:15.043 --> 03:17.077
Worth every penny.
每一分钱都值得。

03:17.146 --> 03:20.560
[together]
Oh, ooh, oh, oh.
[一起]
哦，哦，哦，哦。

03:20.629 --> 03:23.008
Oh, good, our next stop.
噢，很好，我们的下一站。

03:24.181 --> 03:27.733
A summons for jury duty. Lucky.
担任陪审员的传票。幸运的。

03:27.802 --> 03:30.284
Special delivery.
特别送货。

03:30.353 --> 03:33.629
- Great job, Mr. Mailman.
- Huh?
- 干得好，邮差先生。
- 啊？

03:33.698 --> 03:35.146
Oops.
哎呀。

03:36.664 --> 03:37.664
Yep.
是的。

03:39.939 --> 03:41.388
Ugh.
啊。

03:41.457 --> 03:43.871
Must be a defective mail slot.
肯定是邮件槽有缺陷。

03:43.939 --> 03:45.595
Aha.
啊哈。

03:46.974 --> 03:48.388
That ought to do it.
应该可以做到这一点。

03:53.215 --> 03:55.388
Maybe I'll
just try the doorbell.
也许我会
试试门铃。

03:57.146 --> 03:58.629
[doorbell rings]
[门铃响]

03:58.698 --> 04:00.388
Can I help you?
我可以帮你吗？

04:00.457 --> 04:03.250
[together]
Special delivery.
[一起]
特别送货。

04:03.319 --> 04:05.181
I don't want it!
我不想要它！

04:07.560 --> 04:09.974
Maybe we should just move on
to the next house.
也许我们应该继续前进
到下一个房子。

04:10.043 --> 04:11.871
Pfft, no.
噗，没有。

04:11.939 --> 04:13.905
I am a mailman.
我是一名邮递员。

04:13.974 --> 04:16.319
Like the postal oath says,
正如邮政誓言所说，

04:16.388 --> 04:21.215
neither bunions or onions
nor ditches or dangers
既不是拇囊炎也不是洋葱
也没有沟渠或危险

04:21.284 --> 04:25.112
will stop me from giving stuff
to strangers.
会阻止我给予东西
给陌生人。

04:25.181 --> 04:27.284
[applauds]
[鼓掌]

04:27.353 --> 04:29.595
<i>[soft orchestral music]</i>
<i>[轻柔的管弦乐]</i>

04:29.664 --> 04:30.698
[doorbell rings]
[门铃响]

04:32.250 --> 04:35.664
- Ah!
- Special delivery!
- 啊！
- 特别送货！

04:35.733 --> 04:40.422
- Special un-delivery!
- [screams]
- 特别不发货！
- [尖叫]

04:40.491 --> 04:42.491
Oof.
钱币。

04:43.388 --> 04:48.077
Being a mailman isn't like
being Santa Claus at all.
成为一名邮递员并不像
根本就是圣诞老人。

04:48.146 --> 04:49.802
[gasps]
[喘气]

04:49.871 --> 04:51.767
[jingle bells ringing]
[铃儿响叮当]

04:51.836 --> 04:54.767
[straining]
[紧张]

04:58.526 --> 05:01.836
Ho, ho, ho!
Oh!
嗬，嗬，嗬！
哦！

05:06.008 --> 05:07.526
Ooh!
哦！

05:09.560 --> 05:13.077
Hey, we're beard bros.
- [growls]
嘿，我们是胡子兄弟。
- [咆哮]

05:13.146 --> 05:15.802
Oh, uh, merry Fishmas!
哦，呃，鱼节快乐！

05:15.871 --> 05:19.250
- It's July!
- Just take a letter.
- 七月了！
- 就拿一封信吧。

05:19.319 --> 05:23.802
- I don't want it!
- Neither bunions or onions!
- 我不想要！
- 既不是拇囊炎也不是洋葱！

05:23.871 --> 05:25.905
<i>[upbeat music]</i>
<i>[欢快的音乐]</i>

05:25.974 --> 05:27.871
[screams]
Huh, ooh.
[尖叫声]
呵呵。

05:31.181 --> 05:34.802
Ah.
[screams]
啊。
[尖叫声]

05:34.871 --> 05:37.008
Take your mail!
[grunts]
拿走你的邮件！
[咕哝]

05:37.077 --> 05:39.422
- Hey!
- [grunting]
- 嘿！
- [咕哝]

05:39.491 --> 05:41.422
I'll zip your code so hard!
我会努力压缩你的代码！

05:41.491 --> 05:45.422
Ah!
En garde!
啊!
准备好了！

05:46.871 --> 05:48.284
En lard!
猪油！

05:48.353 --> 05:52.284
- [screaming]
- [screaming]
- [尖叫]
- [尖叫]

05:52.353 --> 05:54.112
- Ho, ha!
- I'm gonna stamp you!
- 嗬，哈！
- 我要给你盖章！

05:54.181 --> 05:55.871
Hi, ha!
- Ha!
嗨，哈！
- 哈！

05:55.939 --> 05:58.181
I'll send you butt express!
我给你寄屁股快递！

05:58.250 --> 06:00.353
[screams]
[尖叫声]

06:06.491 --> 06:08.939
[grunts]
Huh?
[咕哝]
啊？

06:10.319 --> 06:12.664
You can't run
from your civic duties!
你不能跑
来自你的公民义务！

06:15.526 --> 06:18.629
[screaming]
- [screaming]
[尖叫]
- [尖叫]

06:20.077 --> 06:22.526
Oh.
- Ha!
哦。
- 哈！

06:22.595 --> 06:25.077
Get it, slap back,
no take backs!
得到它，拍回来，
没有收回！

06:25.146 --> 06:27.284
[sighs]
[叹气]

06:27.353 --> 06:28.629
[both chuckling]
[两人都笑了]

06:28.698 --> 06:29.767
Not bad.
不错。

06:32.560 --> 06:34.802
This summons is for Bubble Bass,
这个召唤是为了泡泡巴斯，

06:34.871 --> 06:36.802
you nincompoops!
你们这些白痴！

06:43.560 --> 06:45.077
- Hm.
- Hm.
- 嗯。
- 嗯。

06:45.146 --> 06:46.939
[bell rings and clatters]
[铃声和叮当声]

06:47.008 --> 06:48.974
<i>- Coming.</i>
- Ah!
<i>- 来了。</i>
- 啊！

06:49.043 --> 06:50.664
- Uh! <i>
- Don't leave!</i>
- 呃！ <我>
- 不要离开！</i>

06:52.043 --> 06:53.767
<i>Almost there.</i>
<i>快到了。</i>

06:53.836 --> 06:55.353
- Ha!
- Ha!
- 哈！
- 哈！

06:58.146 --> 07:01.388
Oh, boy, I never get visitors.
哦，天哪，我从来没有接待过访客。

07:01.457 --> 07:05.043
Special delivery
for one special, old man.
特快专递
献给一位特殊的老人。

07:05.112 --> 07:07.733
Uh, uh, mm...
呃呃呃嗯……

07:07.802 --> 07:13.526
I can't find any mail for him.
- Oh, I never get any mail.
我找不到他的任何邮件。
- 哦，我从来没有收到过任何邮件。

07:13.595 --> 07:16.388
[sobbing]
That's so sad.
[抽泣]
太悲伤了。

07:16.457 --> 07:18.767
Let's give him some of
the other mail, huh?
我们给他一些
另一封邮件，嗯？

07:21.388 --> 07:23.664
I found a letter for you,
Old Man Walker.
我找到一封信给你
沃克老人。

07:24.905 --> 07:26.836
[beeping]
[嘟嘟声]

07:30.181 --> 07:33.871
I've been drafted!
Oh, boy!
我已经被征召入伍了！
哦，孩子！

07:33.939 --> 07:36.802
Wow, if one letter
made him this happy,
哇，如果一封信
让他如此幸福，

07:36.871 --> 07:39.215
I bet all of the mail
will make him explode with joy.
我打赌所有的邮件
会让他高兴得爆炸。

07:39.284 --> 07:41.146
[laughs]
[笑]

07:41.215 --> 07:45.353
Sure, wow, all of this for me?
当然，哇，这一切都是为了我？

07:47.319 --> 07:48.767
[explosion]
[爆炸]

07:48.836 --> 07:51.767
[laughter]
[笑声]

07:55.112 --> 07:57.215
What's next, Postman Patrick?
接下来做什么，邮递员帕特里克？

07:57.284 --> 07:59.595
[gulps]
Mm-mm.
[吞咽]
嗯嗯。

07:59.664 --> 08:02.319
[sighs]
We're all out of mail.
[叹气]
我们都没有邮件了。

08:02.388 --> 08:03.939
[engine rumbles]
[发动机隆隆声]

08:04.008 --> 08:06.767
Let's ask that ice cream truck
if it knows
让我们问问那辆冰淇淋车
如果它知道

08:06.836 --> 08:09.595
where to find some mail.
- That's no ice cream truck.
在哪里可以找到一些邮件。
- 那不是冰淇淋车。

08:09.664 --> 08:12.319
It's a mail truck.
- Really?
这是一辆邮车。
- 真的吗？

08:12.388 --> 08:14.629
I thought all trucks were girls.
我以为所有卡车都是女孩。

08:21.284 --> 08:23.802
[laughter]
[笑声]

08:23.871 --> 08:25.215
[tires squeal]
[轮胎吱吱声]

08:25.284 --> 08:28.422
Wow, we hit the postal jackpot!
哇，我们中了邮政大奖了！

08:28.491 --> 08:30.836
Cool.
[engine rumbles]
凉爽的。
[发动机隆隆声]

08:30.905 --> 08:32.560
Huh?
Hey!
啊？
嘿！

08:32.629 --> 08:36.077
Those weirdos stole my truck!
[grunts]
那些怪人偷了我的卡车！
[咕哝]

08:36.146 --> 08:39.250
[sirens blaring]
[警笛鸣响]

08:40.457 --> 08:43.457
Follow those postal pilferers!
追随那些邮政盗窃者！

08:43.526 --> 08:46.008
A special delivery.
特别送货。

08:46.077 --> 08:48.422
Special delivery for Fred!
弗雷德的特别送货！

08:49.457 --> 08:51.008
- Mwah.
- Huh?
- 哇。
- 啊？

08:52.560 --> 08:54.974
[growls]
Who's Carol?
[咆哮]
卡罗尔是谁？

08:55.043 --> 08:56.491
[chuckles]
[笑声]

08:58.215 --> 09:00.698
This one's for you, Penny!
这是给你的，佩妮！

09:02.008 --> 09:05.250
[screaming]
[尖叫]

09:06.595 --> 09:09.043
Huh?
Oh, great.
啊？
哦，太好了。

09:09.112 --> 09:11.905
The raft I ordered
has finally arrived.
我订购的木筏
终于到了。

09:11.974 --> 09:15.491
[screaming]
[尖叫]

09:15.560 --> 09:18.491
<i>[dramatic music]</i>
<i>[戏剧音乐]</i>

09:18.560 --> 09:23.043
<i>♪ ♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>

09:23.112 --> 09:23.939
[metal clanks]
- Huh?
[金属叮当声]
- 啊？

09:24.008 --> 09:25.319
Pirates!
海盗！

09:25.388 --> 09:27.043
- Wha...?
- Wha...?
- 世界卫生大会...？
- 世界卫生大会...？

09:27.112 --> 09:28.595
[both growling]
[双方咆哮]

09:28.664 --> 09:31.733
Why are these pirates
dressed like mail people?
为什么这些海盗
穿得像邮递员？

09:31.802 --> 09:35.526
- They want to steal our mail!
- Repel the boarders!
- 他们想偷我们的邮件！
- 击退寄宿生！

09:35.595 --> 09:38.353
Repelling boarders, sir!
排斥寄宿生，先生！

09:38.422 --> 09:39.939
- Ugh!
- Harold!
- 呃！
- 哈罗德！

09:40.008 --> 09:41.698
No!
不！

09:44.629 --> 09:47.250
I'm shipping these COD.
我正在运送这些货到付款。

09:47.319 --> 09:49.491
Crash on delivery.
交货时崩溃。

09:49.560 --> 09:52.698
<i>[upbeat music]</i>
<i>[欢快的音乐]</i>

09:52.767 --> 09:56.560
Eeh, oh.
And here comes some air mail.
呃，哦。
一些航空邮件来了。

09:59.319 --> 10:00.595
[retches]
[干呕]

10:02.043 --> 10:04.905
[screaming]
[尖叫]

10:07.491 --> 10:08.767
Huh?
啊？

10:08.836 --> 10:11.112
Another jury summons
for Bubble Bass.
另一个陪审团传票
对于泡泡低音。

10:17.353 --> 10:19.043
Special delivery!
特别发货！

10:20.802 --> 10:23.560
Oh, all we have left
is junk mail!
哦，我们只剩下一切了
是垃圾邮件！

10:23.629 --> 10:24.939
Don't worry.
不用担心。

10:25.008 --> 10:27.974
They'll never find us
in this post office.
他们永远找不到我们
在这个邮局。

10:33.284 --> 10:35.112
<i>♪ ♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>

10:35.181 --> 10:37.939
[sighs]
[doorbell rings]
[叹气]
[门铃响]

10:41.284 --> 10:43.388
Here's today's mail, warden.
这是今天的邮件，典狱长。

10:43.457 --> 10:46.353
[together]
Special delivery.
[一起]
特别送货。

10:46.422 --> 10:49.112
[both chuckle]
[两人都笑了]

[两人都笑了]